{"answer_text":"Good support reporting covers first-response time, resolution time, backlog and CSAT, ideally by channel. Strong options:\n\n### Top picks\n\n1. **Brightdesk Helpdesk** — a dependable help desk with SLAs, macros and detailed reporting.\n2. **Calmline** — a calm, fast shared inbox with collision detection and CRM sidebars.\n3. **Northwind CRM** — a full suite with a service desk included in the higher tiers.\n\n**Bottom line:** If support is your main workflow, go with Brightdesk; otherwise Calmline keeps things simpler.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50fa-7788-b2e1-a6e5f7f71992","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0109,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:02:09.150Z","engine":"chatgpt","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["support software reporting csat"],"latency_ms":7720,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a12333f09a","market_name":"United Kingdom","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[143,153],[465,475]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[237,245]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[324,337]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."}],"model":"gpt-6-luna","prompt_id":"